Each card will feature:
A dynamic confidence score based on data completeness


Multi-agent synthesis logic


A clear call-to-action (e.g., add habit, export for visit, ask Copilot, share it)



Multidisciplinary AI Review Board
To power the above cards, every week (or upon key events), a virtual "review board" of agents will analyze the user’s data:
Agents Involved:
Nutritionist Agent


Gastroenterologist Agent


Psychologist Agent


