Pre-visit preparation


Output:
Card-level insight updates


Optional Weekly Digest Summary card


Copilot nudge suggestions



Card Interaction Model
Horizontally swipeable cards


Dot indicators + card filter by loop


Tap to expand insight, long-press for explanation


Pull-to-refresh across all cards


Copilot nudge embedded in each card footer



Example Actions per Card
Flare-Up Triage: "Log what helped you today" → Add to habit tracker


Diagnostic Support: "Consider asking about this test" → Export for doctor


Treatment Tracking: "Magnesium seems to help. Want to keep tracking it?"


Stability Score: "Your stress is rising again — want to set a bedtime reminder?"



Compliance Protocols
Every insight must:
Avoid diagnostic or prescriptive claims


Use compliant language via Compliance Agent


Example: "This pattern may suggest..." or "Others with similar symptoms have tried..."



Engineering Next Steps
Map each card to responsible agents and insight generation logic


Define agent prompts and feedback scoring logic


Prepare mock data test cases across 8 feedback loops


Design insight quality scoring logic (confidence, completeness, coherence)


Implement export functions for doctor summaries where relevant



Success Metrics
Reduction in average time from flare-up to action


Increase in user habit adherence post-insight


% of insights with follow-through behavior change


% of users exporting clinical summaries for doctor visits


Qualitative feedback from early users: "I finally understood what's happening"



Let’s ensure every line of this page helps the user make sense of their symptoms, treatments, and next steps — with the help of a true copilot, not just a tracker.

