Global Interaction Design
Progressive Disclosure Pattern:
Summary first → user can tap to reveal more depth


Collapse all cards by default on load


Recent data appears before historical views






Let’s create a product experience that makes users feel like they have a real care team in their pocket — personalized, insightful, and truly actionable.









